        </div>

        <div class="research-card">
          <span>03 — INDUSTRIES</span>
          <h3>Where is hiring strongest?</h3>
          <p>What industries are hiring the most data professionals, and where is demand concentrated?</p>
        </div>

        <div class="research-card">
          <span>04 — CAREER</span>
          <h3>What is the outlook for analytics?</h3>
          <p>What do these market patterns suggest about the career outlook for business analytics professionals?</p>
        </div>
